highenergy_crossings#111 1 highenergy_crossings B 5.26 fermi-lat,swift-bat,swift-xrt,xmm,erosita,chandra "v1.0 + amendments v1.1, v1.2" report/highenergy_crossings.md gj-1276 A "1.2 Rsun" 0.00558 grazing "14–195 keV" "Swift/BAT survey pointings, batsurvey per-pointing rates at the channel position" constraint_only flux 37.0 "mCrab (median 3σ upper limit over covered windows, 14–195 keV)" nan nan 1.88 1.88 1.88 9 -1 "" "report/highenergy_crossings.md §2 Swift/BAT arm; surveys/highenergy-crossings/results/bat_v1.md" "Constraint-only arm (no threshold; BAT survey few-σ systematics floor). 22 grazing windows, 9 with ≥ 1 usable pointing (offset ≤ 20°, partial coding ≥ 0.1); min 3σ UL 15 mCrab; max pointing SNR 2.7. Crab measured in 24 pointings (0.0408 units) — empirical mCrab scale; Crab 14–195 keV = 2.31e-08 erg cm^-2 s^-1; power_mw = median 3σ power 1.88e+06 W converted from W. batsurvey (HEASoft 6.24, chbrandt/heasoft container, local CALDB), 238 pointings."
