highenergy_crossings#129 1 highenergy_crossings B 5.26 fermi-lat,swift-bat,swift-xrt,xmm,erosita,chandra "v1.0 + amendments v1.1, v1.2" report/highenergy_crossings.md wolf-359 A "0.1 AU" 0.1 "0.1 AU" "0.3–10 keV" "Swift/XRT PC-mode cleaned events, obsid 00010119025 (47″ aperture, 100-s bins)" ledger_only "" nan "" nan nan nan nan nan 1 -1 "2018-03-06 (+2.9 d)" "report/highenergy_crossings.md §2 Swift/XRT look; surveys/highenergy-crossings/results/xrt_look_v1.md" "A look, not a trial (hypotheses §9): 471 net counts in 4,160 s, mean 0.112 ct/s, 41 bins, median 0.108, max 0.219, no excursion above 3× median; elevated ~3.6× quiescent (2017 campaign 23 visits median 0.031; 2021-12 campaign 80 visits median 0.029; flare visits up to 0.67) — smooth, nothing pulse-like; no constraint. The only in-window Swift XRT observation of the survey. UVOT UV-grism spectrum of the same visit handed to §5.17."
