rubin_crossings#000 1 rubin_crossings B 5.13 rubin "v1.0 + v1.1" report/rubin_crossings.md ross-128 B "0.1 AU" 0.1 "0.1 AU" r "Rubin DP2 dp2.DiaSource difference-image detections, association at predicted relay-track positions (no pixels)" constraint_only flux 1.64 "µJy (served per-detector 5σ point-source depth, magLim r = 23.366; F ≈ 1.8e-18 W m^-2 band-integrated)" nan nan 0.0013 0.0013 0.0013 1 1 "visit 2025091300612, MJD 60932.282 (Δt = −5.66 d from t_ca MJD 60937.94; evt-5197f21cd67b)" "report/rubin_crossings.md §1, §2; surveys/rubin-crossings/results/confirmatory_v1.json; surveys/rubin-crossings/results/coverage_v1.md" "confirmatory_v1.json labels the unit status 'searched' (blind trial with 8 controls) but the constraint is explicitly a threshold statement, not injection-calibrated — recorded constraint_only; S_det = 0, T = 0, 8 valid controls, no exceedance; z family {1000, 2500, 5500, 10000} AU searched, all five z-grid positions on detector 102; rim sample: b(t_visit) = 20.9 Rsun = 0.0973 AU (beams narrower than 0.0973 AU unconstrained; the 1.86 Rsun core never sampled); threshold statement per C1 rule (DP2 has no injections, no pixels) — P ≈ 1.3 kW = 0.0013 MW (converted from kW) band-integrated for a relay at z 1000–10000 AU; equivalent EIRP at z = 1000 AU ~5e11 W (cone gain 4e8); one 30 s sample constrains persistent-during-window emission only; deepest wide-rung single-epoch flux threshold in the covered-window record (~4x ZTF's m90 21.8 in flux, a different record class); image-level re-run when DP2 publishes visit/difference images (late 2026) is the designated follow-up"
