ps1_survey#000 1 ps1_survey A 4.4 ps1 "v2.0 (ps1-hypotheses-v2.0; freeze sha256:be6f3a1c…)" report/ps1_survey.md programme corridor "550-10000 AU" nan corridor g "Pan-STARRS1 DR2 warp cutout stack (~20 warps per band; 360 × 5 × 5 grid at 1″, T0 = 59800)" searched m90 21.71 "AB mag" nan nan nan nan nan 107 -1 "" "report/ps1_survey.md §Completeness table; surveys/panstarrs/results/report_tables.md" "Confirmatory-set median 90 %-completeness (cells × intervals), persistent source; flicker 21.53 (9) / visit 21.73 (36) / block 21.49 (24) (parentheses: cell × interval count with a valid fit). Applies only where the stack can constrain at all: 1,336 of 7,200 confirmatory records are recovery curves. Report states v1's uniform '~21 AB' stack-depth claim did not account for the single-epoch clip or the contamination threshold (v1 depth overstated / localised to the cells that support it)."
